      "description": {
        "fun": "Raboot looks dressed for training, its fluffy fur worn like a tracksuit and snood. The fur keeps out the cold and lets it use hotter fire moves. It practises footwork by kicking Berries off branches and juggling them, hands tucked into its fur so its feet do all the work.",
        "guide": "The middle stage of Scorbunny's line. Raboot's thick, fluffy fur keeps it warm and powers hotter fire moves, and it trains its kicks by juggling Berries. It is the lightest of the middle-stage first partner Pokémon.",
