      "description": {
        "fun": "Galar's star striker juggles a pebble with its feet until it becomes a blazing Pyro Ball, then puts spin on it so opponents can't dodge. It gets pumped up when cheered on, though showing off can land it in trouble. Its Hidden Ability, Libero, is named after a position in football, the sport its whole design draws on.",
        "guide": "The final evolution of Scorbunny and Galar's Fire-type first partner. Cinderace turns pebbles into flaming balls that it kicks at opponents, a design drawn from football players. It has a Gigantamax form.",
